      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWEET ROBBIE (11) resumes from a spell of three-and-a-half months after closing off last campaign in good form, the last run being a solid third over 2130m at Gloucester Park. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw. Well-placed to take this out. FORTITUDE PHIL (10) broke through for the first win of the preparation last time out when he scored by 1.75 metres over 2185m at this track. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Tackles a similar assignment and he can go right on with the job. LIGHTONTHEHILL (2) is on the radar after her last-start fourth over 2130m at Gloucester Park three days ago. ACKNOWLEDGEMENT (4) finished seventh last start in a Group One over 2130m at Gloucester Park, beaten 18 metres by Hez The Boss. Should enjoy a lovely run and looks hard to beat.",
